d27532770b0c05317904da23d2457ed9.poster.avif?t=1653286977\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1784580/extras/d27532770b0c05317904da23d2457ed9.webm?t=1653286977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1784580/extras/d27532770b0c05317904da23d2457ed9.mp4?t=1653286977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The guard of the mortal world</h2>Unlike the cat that can jump through time and space, the stone guards of the temple only move one step at a time in turn order.<br>But they win in their dedication and tirelessness.<br>As long as you appear in their vision, it will chase you, even if you suddenly disappear, they will always wait where you disappeared, no matter how long.<br>But they won't know. The last round in their eyes is just a normal round you can choose on the timeline.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1784580/extras/4328dc8d8c1ac53b0dc3b037b7b232fd.poster.avif?t=1653286977\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1784580/extras/4328dc8d8c1ac53b0dc3b037b7b232fd.webm?t=1653286977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1784580/extras/4328dc8d8c1ac53b0dc3b037b7b232fd.mp4?t=1653286977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Various challenges</h2>From the low-level guards who can only look forward in the early stage, to the ultimate guards who can stare at four directions at the same time in the later stage, the challenges are varied.<br>Every level is in a small space, and there are not too many rounds available.<br>How to plan rationally, is all up to you.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1784580/extras/Gif4.gif?t=1653286977\" /></div>",
